                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty decent game. Adventure is good and voiceover is good but can get repetetive with the same 3-4 lines. Music is good but again repetetive as its the same 2 in battle. No boss battle music varierty.\r\nThe levelling isnt good in this pixel game however as its really slow. (+2 hp +1 MP etc) or +3 Hp +2 MP )\r\n\r\nAs its the Autumn Sale the deluxe edition isnt on sale but yet its cheaper than the standard edition which is on sale so worth getting the deluxe edition as its the DLC with extra adventure.\r\n\r\nGreat game so far but bosses are quite challenging and not easy. Minotaur was difficult.\r\nSome unfairness noticed. Minotaur was blinded by our spells and did full damage attacks and lightning bolt hit and did full damage too while blinded, yet when our heroes were blinded we missed every time?\r\n\r\nOverall a good game but needs some things to be looked at by the developer",
